        <mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;i&gt;Chapter 7&#x27;s benchmarks for 2026&#x27;s fourth quarter, fitted from February 2024. By the quarter the mean has the smallest error and the trend the largest; by the month the same quarter last year has the largest, because its months&#x27; misses do not net against each other. The mean&#x27;s quarter bar, +0.03%, is too short to see. Every bar starts at zero.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="462" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
